om opposite boundaries meet below 9.5m, that lesser height governs.\"}\nLot conditions (not encoded): Section A - small lot (lot < 450 m2, or rear lot < 600 m2 excl. access way) that is 180 m2 or greater\nStructure scope 'dwelling house (development)' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_1']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: Brisbane City Plan 2014 s1.6 Table 1.6.1 item 6 (s32(b) BA, s6 BR): 'Qualitative statements and quantifiable standards for matters provided for under performance criteria 4 under QDC parts MP 1.1 and MP 1.2 ...'. NOTE: Table 1.6.1 still refers to QDC MP1.1/MP1.2; no reference to the Queensland Housing Code was found anywhere in City Plan v37.00/2026. Listed as 'PO3 and AO3' in item 6."}$q$::jsonb);
