e times.\nEditor's note—For the purposes of determining compliance with AO6 reference is to be made to section 1.7.6.\nEditor's note—For the purpose of satisfying AO6(c)(iv), confirmation in writing in the form of a statutory declaration from the registered owner of the adjoining premises is required to be submitted to demonstrate compliance.", "extracted_value": null, "extracted_operator": "conditional"}, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "REFERRAL_TO_LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "effective_from": "2026-09-18", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "BRISBANE"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:LOW_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:LOW_MEDIUM_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:MEDIUM_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:CHARACTER_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:RURAL_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:EMERGING_COMMUNITY"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:ENVIRONMENTAL_MANAGEMENT"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:RURAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:TOWNSHIP"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:HIGH_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}], "subjects": ["CLASS_10A"], "sources": [{"key": "sl_side_setback", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"min_side_boundary_setback\", \"operator\": \"conditional\", \"value\": null, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"1m for habitable spaces\", \"0.5m for non-habitable spaces only, max height 3.5m, max length 15m in LMR/MDR/HDR zones\", \"0.5m for non-habitable spaces only, max height 3.5m, max length 9m in LDR or Character residential zone\"], \"exceptions\": [\"0m cases in AO6(c) (see sl_side_zero_setback)\", \"approved building envelope prevails\"], \"formula_text\": null}\nLot conditions (not encoded): Section A - small lot (lot < 450 m2, or rear lot < 600 m2 excl. access way) that is 180 m2 or greater\nStructure scope 'development - habitable vs non-habitable spaces (non-habitable includes garages, carports, sheds)' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_10A']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: Table 1.6.1 item 11 (ss32(c) and 33 BA): 'Alternative provisions to performance criteria 2 under QDC parts MP1.1 and 1.2 of the QDC boundary clearance and site cover provisions for particular buildings'. NOTE: Table 1.6.1 still refers to QDC MP1.1/MP1.2; no reference to the Queensland Housing Code was found anywhere in City Plan v37.00/2026. Listed as 'PO6 and AO6' in item 11."}$q$::jsonb);
