 separate times.\nEditor's note—For the purposes of determining compliance with AO6 reference is to be made to section 1.7.6.\nEditor's note—For the purpose of satisfying AO6(c)(iv), confirmation in writing in the form of a statutory declaration from the registered owner of the adjoining premises is required to be submitted to demonstrate compliance.", "extracted_value": 0, "extracted_operator": "conditional"}, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "REFERRAL_TO_LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "effective_from": "2026-09-18", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "BRISBANE"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:LOW_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:LOW_MEDIUM_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:MEDIUM_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:CHARACTER_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:RURAL_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:EMERGING_COMMUNITY"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:ENVIRONMENTAL_MANAGEMENT"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:RURAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:TOWNSHIP"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:HIGH_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}], "subjects": ["CLASS_10A"], "sources": [{"key": "sl_side_zero_setback", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"side_setback_0m_permitted\", \"operator\": \"conditional\", \"value\": 0, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"matching extent of existing built-to-boundary wall on adjoining property\", \"adjoining property 300m2 or less and in Residential zone category other than Character zone precinct of Character residential zone\", \"lot avg width 7.5m or less, adjoining property 300m2 or less (not Character zone precinct) with no existing built-to-boundary wall\", \"lot avg width > 7.5m in LDR or Infill housing zone precinct of CR zone where adjoining owner does not object (statutory declaration) - non-habitable only, max height 3m, max length 9m