", \"value\": null, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"6m where lot average depth > 25m\", \"lot average depth 25m or less: 3m for part of building/structure up to 4.5m high\", \"lot average depth 25m or less: 4.5m for part over 4.5m high\"], \"exceptions\": [\"approved building envelope prevails\"], \"formula_text\": null}\nLot conditions (not encoded): Section A - small lot (lot < 450 m2, or rear lot < 600 m2 excl. access way) that is 180 m2 or greater\nStructure scope 'building or structure (all, incl. Class 10a)' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_10A', 'CLASS_1']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: Table 1.6.1 item 11 (ss32(c) and 33 BA): 'Alternative provisions to performance criteria 2 under QDC parts MP1.1 and 1.2 of the QDC boundary clearance and site cover provisions for particular buildings'. NOTE: Table 1.6.1 still refers to QDC MP1.1/MP1.2; no reference to the Queensland Housing Code was found anywhere in City Plan v37.00/2026. Listed as 'PO7 and AO7' in item 11. Text makes no exception for Class 10a outbuildings - a shed/carport in the rear setback would fail AO7 (QHC/QDC concessions for Class 10a do not apply where this alternative provision applies)."}$q$::jsonb);
