oundary_wall_conditions\", \"operator\": \"conditional\", \"value\": null, \"unit\": null, \"conditions\": [\"non-habitable rooms/spaces only where adjoining lot > 300m2\", \"not within 1m of a habitable-room window on adjoining dwelling\", \"not within front or rear boundary setbacks\", \"low maintenance, pre-finished materials\"], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": null}\nLot conditions (not encoded): Section A - small lot (lot < 450 m2, or rear lot < 600 m2 excl. access way) that is 180 m2 or greater\nStructure scope 'built to boundary walls' mapped by keyword to ['ANY'] (default)\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: Table 1.6.1 item 7 (s32(b) BA, s6 BR): qualitative statements/quantifiable standards for QDC MP1.1/MP1.2 performance criteria 5. NOTE: Table 1.6.1 still refers to QDC MP1.1/MP1.2; no reference to the Queensland Housing Code was found anywhere in City Plan v37.00/2026. Listed as 'PO9, AO9.1 and AO9.2' under item 7 (P5 qualitative statements), not under the s33 boundary clearance items."}$q$::jsonb);
