ional\", \"value\": 6, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"max internal width 6m excl. eaves\", \"may be closer to road alignment than the house\", \"crossover may be full width of car accommodation\"], \"exceptions\": [\"supersedes AO5 street frontage setbacks\"], \"formula_text\": null}\nLot conditions (not encoded): Section A - small lot (lot < 450 m2, or rear lot < 600 m2 excl. access way) that is 180 m2 or greater; slope 1 in 4 or greater between front boundary and building setback\nStructure scope 'double carport or garage' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_10A']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: Table 1.6.1 item 10 (ss32(c) and 33 BA): 'Alternative provisions to performance criteria 1 under QDC parts MP1.1 and MP1.2 of the QDC boundary clearance and site cover provisions for particular buildings'. NOTE: Table 1.6.1 still refers to QDC MP1.1/MP1.2; no reference to the Queensland Housing Code was found anywhere in City Plan v37.00/2026. Listed as 'PO13 and AO13.4' in item 10. No minimum front setback stated."}$q$::jsonb);
