SELECT define_provision($q$BCC_CITY_PLAN_2014@2026-09-18$q$, $q$9.3.8.3 Table 9.3.8.3.A, PO14/AO14.1$q$, 'ACCEPTABLE_OUTCOME', $q$AO14.1
Development that is within 2m for the storey closest to the ground level or 9m for storeys above, of a neighbouring dwelling house (refer to Figure g) incorporates windows, decks, balconies, terraces or roof decks that:
- are offset from the window of a habitable room in the adjacent dwelling house to limit direct outlook as shown in Figure h; or
- where a window, have:
- sill heights of 1.5m above the floor level of that storey; or
- are covered by fixed obscure glazing in any part of the window below 1.5m above floor level of that storey; or
- have fixed external screens; or
- where at the ground storey, fencing to a height of 1.5m above ground storey floor level;
- where a deck, balcony, terrace, or roof deck have fixed screening.$q$, 'VERIFIED_VERBATIM', $q$rule 15314$q$, NULL, $q$Dwelling house (small lot) code$q$, NULL, $q$https://cityplan.brisbane.qld.gov.au/eplan/api/l/r/163/0/false/28-Sep-2026/false$q$, NULL, $q$sl_privacy_decks_windows$q$);
