Table 1.6.1 still refers to QDC MP1.1/MP1.2; no reference to the Queensland Housing Code was found anywhere in City Plan v37.00/2026. Listed as 'PO20 and AO20' in item 12. Swimming pools count as impervious area per the AO20 note."}$q$::jsonb);
