SELECT define_provision($q$BCC_CITY_PLAN_2014@2026-09-18$q$, $q$9.3.8.3 Table 9.3.8.3.A Section B, PO21/AO21.1-AO21.2$q$, 'ACCEPTABLE_OUTCOME', $q$AO21.1
Development ensures the combined total length of the building or building components:
- does not exceed 25m; or
- is in accordance with an approved development footprint plan for the site.
Note—The total length of a building or building components includes garages, decks, balconies, verandahs and other projections. It does not include eaves or sunhoods.
Note—Where demonstrating compliance with PO28/AO28.1 in the Subdivision code, compliance with this acceptable outcome must be noted on a development footprint plan. | AO21.2
Development that results in a building length that exceeds 15m includes an open-to-sky mid-building break to one side boundary that:
- has a minimum dimension of:
- 3m by 3m; or
- 2.5m by 4m; or
- is in accordance with an approved development footprint plan for the site.
Refer to Figure m.
Note—Where demonstrating compliance with PO28/AO28.1 in the Subdivision code, compliance with this acceptable outcome must be noted on a development footprint plan.$q$, 'VERIFIED_VERBATIM', $q$rule 60876$q$, NULL, $q$Dwelling house (small lot) code$q$, NULL, $q$https://cityplan.brisbane.qld.gov.au/eplan/api/l/r/163/0/false/28-Sep-2026/false$q$, NULL, $q$slb_building_length_and_break$q$);
