lling house (small lot) code; or\n- have sill heights of 1.5m above floor level; or\n- are covered by fixed obscure glazing in any part of the window below 1.5m above floor level; or\n- have fixed external screens; or\n- in the case of screening for a ground floor level, fencing to a height of 1.5m above ground floor level;\n- any screening devices required by (c) or (d) above, are:\n- solid translucent screens, perforated or slatted panels or fixed louvres that have a maximum of 25% openings, with a maximum opening dimension of 50mm, that are permanently fixed and durable (refer to Figure i and Figure j in the Dwelling house (small lot) code);\n- offset a minimum of 0.3m from the face of any window;\n- may be hinged to facilitate emergency egress only. |", "extracted_value": null, "extracted_operator": "conditional"}, "unit": "%", "on_noncompliance": "PLANNING_APPROVAL_REQUIRED", "effective_from": "2026-09-18", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "BRISBANE"}, {"level": "OVERLAY", "overlay": "BCC:OV:DWELLING_HOUSE_CHARACTER_OVERLAY"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:HIGH_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "OVERLAY", "overlay": "BCC:OV:DWELLING_HOUSE_CHARACTER_OVERLAY"}], "subjects": ["CLASS_1"], "sources": [{"key": "pad_dhc_small_lot_renovation_footprint", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"max_total_building_footprint\", \"operator\": \"conditional\", \"value\": null, \"unit\": \"%\", \"conditions\": [\"55% of site area on lot < 180m2\", \"50% on any other lot\", \"roof deck/viewing platform >= 1.5m from side boundary, <= 7m above ground or upper roof height\"], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": null}\nLot conditions (not encoded): small lot; within building envelope of small-lot code (section A or B) or approved envelope\nStructure scope 'renovations and extensions to an existing dwelling house' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_1']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: NO\nResearcher notes: Planning category trigger only."}$q$::jsonb);
