Development is either:
- set back from side boundaries to a distance within 20% of the average of other houses in the street that were built in 1946 or before; or
- set back a minimum distance described by the Queensland Development Code for buildings where not on a small lot.$q$, 'VERIFIED_VERBATIM', $q$rule 12208$q$, NULL, $q$Sherwood—Graceville district neighbourhood plan code$q$, NULL, $q$https://cityplan.brisbane.qld.gov.au/eplan/api/l/r/113/0/false/28-Sep-2026/false$q$, NULL, $q$np_sherwood_westside_side_setback$q$);
SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "BCC.np_sherwood_westside_side_setback", "instrument_version": "BCC_CITY_PLAN_2014@2026-09-18", "topic": "SETBACK.SIDE", "title": "7.2.19.3.3 Table 7.2.19.3.3.A, PO3/AO3.5", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "BUILDING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTABLE_OUTCOME", "measurement": "SCHEME_SETBACK_SIDE", "operator": ">=", "value": {"op": "unencoded", "text": "AO3.5\nDevelopment is either:\n- set back from side boundaries to a distance within 20% of the average of other houses in the street that were built in 1946 or before; or\n- set back a minimum distance described by the Queensland Development Code for buildings where not on a small lot.", "extracted_value": null, "extracted_operator": "conditional"}, "unit": null, "on_noncompliance": "REFERRAL_TO_LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "effective_from": "2026-09-18", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "BRISBANE"}, {"level": "LOCAL_PLAN_PRECINCT", "local_plan_precinct": "BCC:NP_SHERWOOD_GRACEVILLE/NPP-001"}], "subjects": ["ANY"], "sources": [{"key": "np_sherwood_westside_side_setback", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"side_setback\", \"operator\": \"conditional\", \"value\": null, \"unit\": null, \"conditions\": [\"within 20% of average of other pre-1947 houses in street\", \"or QDC minimum where not on a small lot\"], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": null}\nLocal plan: Sherwood—Graceville district neighbourhood plan\nStructure scope 'development' mapped by keyword to ['ANY'] (default)\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: Table 1.6.1 item 11 (ss32(c) and 33 BA): 'Alternative provisions to performance criteria 2 under QDC parts MP1.1 and 1.2 of the QDC boundary clearance and site cover provisions for particular buildings'. NOTE: Table 1.6.1 still refers to QDC MP1.1/MP1.2; no reference to the Queensland Housing Code was found anywhere in City Plan v37.00/2026. AO3.5(b) itself points back to 'the Queensland Development Code' - with QHC now in force this cross-reference needs confirmation."}$q$::jsonb);
UPDATE rule_versions SET status = 'DRAFT' WHERE rule_version_id = $q$BCC.np_sherwood_westside_side_setback@2026-09-18$q$;
