Note—Unless specified, the above building works are still subject to the siting provisions of the Building Regulation 2021. |$q$, 'VERIFIED_VERBATIM', $q$rule 4588$q$, NULL, $q$Part 5 Table 5.3.4.1 Prescribed accepted development$q$, NULL, $q$https://cityplan.brisbane.qld.gov.au/eplan/api/l/r/222/0/false/28-Sep-2026/false$q$, $q$'For the purpose of this provision the setbacks of the Building Regulation 2021 are to be read as taken to the wall, not the outermost projection.'$q$, $q$bcc_hdr_pad_dhc_small_lot_raising_side_setback$q$);
SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "BCC.bcc_hdr_pad_dhc_small_lot_raising_side_setback", "instrument_version": "BCC_CITY_PLAN_2014@2026-09-18", "topic": "SETBACK.SIDE", "title": "5.3.4 Table 5.3.4.1 (Building work, Dwelling house character overlay, small lot, outside building envelope - raising only)", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "PLANNING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTED_DEVELOPMENT_REQUIREMENT", "measurement": "SCHEME_SETBACK_SIDE", "operator": ">=", "value": {"op": "unencoded", "text": "setback = Building Regulation 2021 (QDC/QHC) side setback for the raised building height, measured to the wall", "extracted_value": null, "extracted_operator": "conditional"}, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "PLANNING_APPROVAL_REQUIRED", "effective_from": "2026-09-18", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "BRISBANE"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BCC:HIGH_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "OVERLAY", "overlay": "BCC:OV:DWELLING_HOUSE_CHARACTER_OVERLAY"}], "subjects": ["CLASS_1"], "sources": [{"key": "bcc_hdr_pad_dhc_small_lot_raising_side_setback", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"min_side_boundary_setback\", \"operator\": \"conditional\", \"value\": null, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"side boundary setbacks comply with the setbacks under the Building Regulation 2021 (QDC MP1.1/MP1.2, now QHC)\", \"measured to the wall, not the outermost projection (scheme note)\"], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": \"setback = Building Regulation 2021 (QDC/QHC) side setback for the raised building height, measured to the wall\"}\nLot conditions (not encoded): small lot (lot < 450 m2, or rear lot < 600 m2 excl. access way); building work outside the building envelope in the acceptable outcomes of section A or B of the Dwelling house (small lot) code (or outside an approved envelope)\nStructure scope 'existing dwelling house - raising a building only' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_1']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: NO\nResearcher notes: Same row as bcc_hdr_pad_dhc_small_lot_raising_height (split by topic, as brisbane.json does for multi-topic clauses). Row applies in all Dwelling house character overlay zones, not only HDR."}$q$::jsonb);
